      "instance_name": "america_first",
      "label": "America First political slogan",
      "description": "A nationalist political slogan popularized by Donald Trump and associated with his 2016 presidential campaign and subsequent policies. It implies prioritizing American interests above those of other nations, often used in the context of trade, immigration, and foreign policy. The phrase is frequently used in political discourse to rally support for protectionist or isolationist policies.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_0366b3a7"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
