      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "political_propaganda",
      "label": "Political Propaganda",
      "description": "The strategic dissemination of information to influence public opinion or behavior in favor of a particular political agenda. The meme uses the juxtaposition of the 'America First' slogan with the context of elections to promote a specific political message, which is a form of propaganda. This technique aims to frame the politician or ideology as prioritizing national interests, thereby influencing voter perception.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
