      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "isolationism",
      "label": "Isolationism",
      "description": "A foreign policy stance that emphasizes a nation's self-reliance and minimizes involvement in international affairs. The 'America First' slogan is often associated with isolationist tendencies, suggesting a retreat from global commitments to focus on domestic priorities. This concept is implied in the meme's context, as it suggests prioritizing American interests over international obligations.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_0366b3a7"
